{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solos is a solitaire-inspired roguelike deckbuilder all about creating unique synergies and entering into flow state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027850/extras/e02a1e7bbd425c81a589001555989c01.avif?t=1758071263\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Clear cards from the field, earn gold from combos, until the field is clear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Buy items, cards and upgrades from the shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Cards are dealt again, repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you run out of cards in your deck - game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027850/extras/bdfbf19011ff94de03676f1fbad35db0.avif?t=1758071263\" width=1560 height=880 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of Solos, it feels like an escape, but really, what are you hiding from?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a while numbers become shapes, and shapes become numbers... it all starts to blur. CLICK CLICK CLICK</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027850?t=1758071263","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027850?t=1758071263","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027850/9b90a5da8be1773aae66bd13c59775da78b26c8c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758071263","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027850/9b90a5da8be1773aae66bd13c59775da78b26c8c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758071263","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solos is a solitaire-inspired roguelike deckbuilder all about creating unique synergies and entering into flow state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027850/extras/e02a1e7bbd425c81a589001555989c01.avif?t=1758071263\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Clear cards from the field, earn gold from combos, until the field is clear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Buy items, cards and upgrades from the shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Cards are dealt again, repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you run out of cards in your deck - game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027850/extras/bdfbf19011ff94de03676f1fbad35db0.avif?t=1758071263\" width=1560 height=880 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of Solos, it feels like an escape, but really, what are you hiding from?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a while numbers become shapes, and shapes become numbers... it all starts to blur. CLICK CLICK CLICK</p>","developers":["Unsound"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027850/e0c00bfbfad4c480bcab48fd2d3f4698ed1fc1ad/header.jpg?t=1758071263","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Solos","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-8250U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</st